OL,3,ANvidia's shares plunge as US tech
OL,4,Agiant's board reportedly weighs ousting
OL,5,ACEO Jensen Huang
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe board of tech giant Nvidia is
OL,8,Fconsidering whether to oust its CEO
OL,9,FJensen Huang, the BBC's US partner CBS
OL,10,FNews and other US media report
OL,12,FStocks in the firm have plummeted after
OL,13,Fthe New York Times reported that Huang
OL,14,Fhad a second affair with an executive
OL,15,Fat the company
OL,17,FThe company has already launched an
OL,18,Finvestigation into an affair between
OL,19,FHuang and an alleged Chinese spy, Alice
OL,20,FHuang. The FBI is also investigating it
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
