OL,3,ANvidia's shares plunge as US tech
OL,4,Agiant's board reportedly weighs ousting
OL,5,ACEO Jensen Huang
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier this week, the CEO admitted
OL,8,Fthat he had been "unfaithful" to his
OL,9,Fwife and apologised to her and their
OL,10,Fchildren
OL,12,FNvidia is the world's second most
OL,13,Fvaluable company after Apple, and is at
OL,14,Fthe heart of the AI race between the US
OL,15,Fand China
